codex
The code supports a conditional defect, not an already-connected deployment path: C1/C2 can change the proposal, and the bounded builder can change its rows when given a different proposal. The implemented pilot shares fixed references instead. I also found that route training is independent, so the requested single-informative combinations may be assembled from matching retained checkpoints without new learning.
